      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the process for AMAG, begin with the arrival of the customer order."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures process initiation and the triggering event. Modeling this as an init node plus two action steps ('start process', 'arrival...') is harmless structural splitting/redundancy that preserves behaviour."
    },
